From 3d34c42da1db7a15bc1563bd2cbf5959412ca8b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nick Kennedy <nick@nick-kennedy.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:43:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] kosmickrisp: log the command sequence of multisampled FDM
 passes

KK_SEQ_LOG=1 logs rendering begins and ends, custom resolve switches,
draws with their fragment shader outputs, and barriers inside the pass,
for three multisampled FDM passes once 3000 have been recorded. Fragment
shader info now records outputs_written.

AI-written commit text (biblioklept).

